    {
      "Original": "Disables 3D render while game is minimized. \n\nThis option will bring GPU usage down significantly while game is minimized. \n\nIt is adviced to use frame limiter in conjunction with this option to reduce CPU usage as well.\n\nWarning: this option may cause flashes, flickers, visual smearing so please use it only if you do not have increased photosensitivity. ",
      "Context": "Mini.Draw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.HelpMarker",
      "Translated": "游戏最小化时暂停 3D 渲染。\n\n这能显著降低游戏最小化时的 GPU 占用。\n\n建议同时使用帧率限制器来降低 CPU 占用。\n\n警告：此选项可能导致闪光、闪烁或画面拖影。对闪光敏感时请勿使用。 ",
      "Source": "library"
